<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>You're in. Welcome to Deadline.</title>
  <style>
    * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    body {
      font-family: Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;
      background-color: #0d0d0d;
      color: #e8e2d9;
      padding: 40px 16px;
    }
    .wrapper {
      max-width: 560px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      background-color: #141414;
      border: 1px solid #2a2a2a;
      border-radius: 8px;
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    .header {
      background-color: #1a1a1a;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #2a2a2a;
      padding: 32px 40px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .header .brand {
      font-size: 15px;
      letter-spacing: 0.15em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: #c9a96e;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }
    .header h1 {
      font-size: 22px;
      font-weight: normal;
      color: #f0ebe3;
      line-height: 1.3;
    }
    .body {
      padding: 36px 40px;
    }
    .body p {
      font-size: 15px;
      line-height: 1.7;
      color: #b0a899;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }
    .body h2 {
      font-size: 17px;
      font-weight: normal;
      color: #f0ebe3;
      margin: 28px 0 12px;
    }
    .checklist {
      list-style: none;
      margin: 0 0 16px;
      padding: 0;
    }
    .checklist li {
      font-size: 15px;
      line-height: 1.9;
      color: #d8d1c5;
    }
    .cta-wrapper {
      text-align: center;
      margin: 28px 0;
    }
    .cta {
      display: inline-block;
      background-color: #c9a96e;
      color: #0d0d0d;
      font-family: Georgia, serif;
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: bold;
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
      text-decoration: none;
      padding: 14px 36px;
      border-radius: 4px;
    }
    .cta.secondary {
      background-color: transparent;
      color: #c9a96e;
      border: 1px solid #c9a96e;
    }
    .divider {
      border: none;
      border-top: 1px solid #2a2a2a;
      margin: 28px 0;
    }
    .footer {
      padding: 20px 40px 28px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .footer p {
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #4a4540;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="wrapper">
    <div class="header">
      <p class="brand">Deadline</p>
      <h1>You&rsquo;re officially on the list.</h1>
    </div>

    <div class="body">
      <p>Thanks for joining Deadline.</p>

      <p>
        We&rsquo;re building a private marketplace where verified travelers guess
        the hotel&rsquo;s secret price to win the room.
      </p>

      <p>
        Unlike public discounts, hotels never reveal their minimum price&mdash;so
        they can fill empty rooms without hurting their brand.
      </p>

      <p>
        Today, a handful of independent hotels are already accepting bids, and
        we&rsquo;re adding more every week.
      </p>

      <p>As we grow, you&rsquo;ll be the first to know when:</p>

      <ul class="checklist">
        <li>&#9989; New hotels join</li>
        <li>&#9989; Launch parties</li>
        <li>&#9989; Exclusive discounts</li>
      </ul>

      <p>In the meantime&hellip;</p>

      <h2>Ready to play?</h2>
      <p>Browse the hotels already accepting bids.</p>

      <div class="cta-wrapper">
        <a href="<%= marketplaceUrl %>" class="cta">Start Bidding</a>
      </div>

      <hr class="divider" />

      <h2>Follow the journey</h2>
      <p>We&rsquo;re documenting the launch in real time.</p>

      <div class="cta-wrapper">
        <a href="<%= instagramUrl %>" class="cta secondary">Follow us on Instagram</a>
      </div>

      <hr class="divider" />

      <h2>One favor</h2>
      <p>Is there an independent hotel you&rsquo;d love to see on Deadline?</p>
      <p>
        Simply forward this email to the owner or GM&mdash;or introduce us
        directly. Every hotel that joins makes the marketplace better for
        everyone.
      </p>

      <div class="cta-wrapper">
        <a href="<%= referHotelUrl %>" class="cta secondary">Refer a Hotel</a>
      </div>

      <hr class="divider" />

      <p>Let&rsquo;s goooo!</p>
    </div>

    <div class="footer">
      <p><%= appName %> &mdash; Life is short. Travel now.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
